second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the genre of the film \\\"Fools Rush In\\\"?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0316-62525b4bd850:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 162, \"text\": \"Fools Rush In (1949 film) Fools Rush In is a 1949 British comedy film directed by John Paddy Carstairs and starring Sally Ann Howes, Guy Rolfe and Nigel Buchanan.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0316-62525b4bd850:d00\", \"start\": 163, \"end\": 308, \"text\": \"Pamela Dickson (Sally Ann Howes) is about to get married to her fiancé Joe Trent (Nigel Buchanan), when her long-lost father (Guy Rolfe) arrives.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0316-62525b4bd850:d00\", \"start\": 309, \"end\": 518, \"text\": \"Ostensibly a cad, he turns out to be just the opposite, so she immediately puts her own plans on hold to arrange a reconciliation between her father and mother (Nora Swinburne) before marrying her beloved Joe.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0316-62525b4bd850:d00\", \"start\": 519, \"end\": 580, \"text\": \"\\\"TV Guide\\\" called it \\\"A redundant film which only fools would\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0316-62525b4bd850:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 498, \"text\": \"Fools Rush In (1973 film) Fools Rush In is a 1973 documentary that was made as part of the \\\"Omnibus\\\" series and followed the popular double act of Eric Morecambe and Ernie Wise whilst they were rehearsing one of the programmes for transmission on their BBC programme; it was to become the seventh episode of their seventh series and was broadcast on 16 February 1973 with guest stars Anita Harris and Anthony Sharp, both of whom appear in the documentary which is filmed in a fly-on-the-wall style.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0316-62525b4bd850:d01\", \"start\": 499, \"end\": 572, \"text\": \"The programme is an insight into how the popular duo honed their material\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0316-62525b4bd850:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 145, \"text\": \"Fools Rush In (1997 film) Fools Rush In is a 1997 American romantic comedy film starring Matthew Perry and Salma Hayek, directed by Andy Tennant.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0316-62525b4bd850:d02\", \"start\": 146, \"end\": 318, \"text\": \"Alex Whitman (Matthew Perry) is an architect from New York City who is sent to Las Vegas to supervise the construction of a nightclub that his firm has been hired to build.\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0316-62525b4bd850:d02\", \"start\": 319, \"end\": 505, \"text\": \"Alex is a strait-laced WASP-ish type who, while researching possible menus items for the new nightclub, meets Isabel Fuentes (Salma Hayek), a free-spirited Mexican-American photographer.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0316-62525b4bd850:d02\", \"start\": 506, \"end\": 607, \"text\": \"Alex and Isabel are overtaken by lust at first sight and end up spending the night together; however,\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0316-62525b4bd850:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0316-62525b4bd850:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Fools Rush In\", \"scope\": \"film\", \"claim\": \"The genre of the film \\\"Fools Rush In\\\" is comedy.\", \"answer\": \"comedy\", \"quote\": \"Fools Rush In (1949 film) Fools Rush In is a 1949 British comedy film directed by John Paddy Carstairs and starring Sally Ann Howes, Guy Rolfe and Nigel Buchanan.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0316-62525b4bd850:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0316-62525b4bd850:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Fools Rush In\", \"scope\": \"film\", \"claim\": \"The genre of the film \\\"Fools Rush In\\\" is documentary.\", \"answer\": \"documentary\", \"quote\": \"Fools Rush In (1973 film) Fools Rush In is a 1973 documentary that was made as part of the \\\"Omnibus\\\" series and followed the popular double act of Eric Morecambe and Ernie Wise whilst they were rehearsing one of the programmes for transmission on their BBC programme; it was to become the seventh episode of their seventh series and was broadcast on 16 February 1973 with guest stars Anita Harris and Anthony Sharp, both of whom appear in the documentary which is filmed in a fly-on-the-wall style.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0316-62525b4bd850:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0316-62525b4bd850:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"Fools Rush In\", \"scope\": \"film\", \"claim\": \"The genre of the film \\\"Fools Rush In\\\" is romantic comedy.\", \"answer\": \"romantic comedy\", \"quote\": \"Fools Rush In (1997 film) Fools Rush In is a 1997 American romantic comedy film starring Matthew Perry and Salma Hayek, directed by Andy Tennant.\", \"original_document_number\": 3}], \"R5_answers\": [\"comedy\", \"documentary\", \"romantic comedy\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"comedy\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"documentary\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"romantic comedy\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
